01:15:24.811 --> 01:15:25.938
[People are noisy]

1470
01:15:26.021 --> 01:15:27.648
Oh, really, mom, please, please, really!

1471
01:15:27.731 --> 01:15:28.941
(희수)
야, 이놈의 새끼야, 지금

1472
01:15:29.024 --> 01:15:31.026
엄마 노래하는데 맥을 끊고 그래

1473
01:15:31.109 --> 01:15:32.694
아, 맨날 오는 깡패들 있잖아요

1474
01:15:32.778 --> 01:15:35.072
아, 그 깡패들이 안 군 아저씨
막 때리고 있어요

1475
01:15:35.155 --> 01:15:36.323
[긴장되는 음악]
- (희수) 응?
- (Cheolwook) What is it?

1476
01:15:36.406 --> 01:15:38.450
- (In advance) Mr. Lee!
- (Hongsik) What?

1477
01:15:38.534 --> 01:15:41.537
(Cheolwook)
These guys are in front of the sharks today
[Yeonjin throws her chopsticks]

1478
01:15:41.620 --> 01:15:43.580
You're sprinkling blood!
[Yeonjin’s laughter]

1479
01:15:43.664 --> 01:15:44.873
These bastards are good

1480
01:15:44.957 --> 01:15:46.124
It's time to die today

1481
01:15:46.208 --> 01:15:47.042
(Hongsik)
Let's go

1482
01:15:47.125 --> 01:15:49.461
(Toto)
Let’s hang out today, eh!

1483
01:15:49.545 --> 01:15:50.837
(Chae Shin)
No, drink, drink…

1484
01:15:53.757 --> 01:15:56.009
[People are noisy]

1485
01:16:02.307 --> 01:16:03.767
[The subordinates’ groans of strength]

1486
01:16:03.850 --> 01:16:04.977
(Toto)
Ki-seok!

1487
01:16:05.060 --> 01:16:07.229
[Drums sound]
[Tenant’s spirit]

1488
01:16:08.772 --> 01:16:11.149
[upbeat music]

1489
01:17:11.960 --> 01:17:14.463
[A commotion is heard]

1490
01:17:19.426 --> 01:17:21.720
(Chayoung)
Hey, are you fighting?
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1491
01:17:26.391 --> 01:17:27.768
Yes, Boss Joe.

1492
01:17:28.685 --> 01:17:29.686
(Vincenzo)
yes

1493
01:17:30.270 --> 01:17:32.064
It's going very well

1494
01:17:32.147 --> 01:17:33.523
(President Cho)
Yes?

1495
01:17:33.607 --> 01:17:35.692
No, that can't be possible.

1496
01:17:35.776 --> 01:17:38.528
One of the people I hired

1497
01:17:38.612 --> 01:17:40.155
Classified as primary contact

1498
01:17:40.238 --> 01:17:44.409
(President Cho)
But those good citizens
I might be harmed

1499
01:17:44.493 --> 01:17:46.078
Everyone went to the public health center.

1500
01:17:46.161 --> 01:17:47.579
[laughter]

1501
01:17:48.163 --> 01:17:50.540
no, then now
Who are the people fighting...

1502
01:17:51.041 --> 01:17:53.126
[People are noisy]

1503
01:17:54.086 --> 01:17:55.504
[upbeat music]

1504
01:17:55.587 --> 01:17:57.673
(Chayoung)
Oh my, oh my

1505
01:18:05.639 --> 01:18:07.474
Does this seem like a scene I've seen a lot of times somewhere?

1506
01:18:20.112 --> 01:18:22.197
[Bell sound effect]

1507
01:19:02.654 --> 01:19:04.531
[Rhythmic music]
(Chayoung)
this investment agreement

1508
01:19:04.614 --> 01:19:06.241
It will never happen if you leave it alone.

1509
01:19:06.324 --> 01:19:09.494
(Myunghee)
That incident from before
You know there's still some left, right?

1510
01:19:09.995 --> 01:19:12.664
(Minseong)
Don't talk nonsense to people around you

1511
01:19:12.748 --> 01:19:14.040
(Vincenzo)
Is there a way?

1512
01:19:14.124 --> 01:19:17.878
(Chayoung)
Another way is to reach an agreement with the bank president.
I can break it down

1513
01:19:17.961 --> 01:19:20.338
(Vincenzo)
And villains don't deserve love

1514
01:19:20.422 --> 01:19:22.048
Love also needs qualifications

1515
01:19:22.132 --> 01:19:25.093
(Junwoo)
I want someone who will be my devil
Because I need it

1516
01:19:25.177 --> 01:19:26.887
[gunshot]
(Junwoo)
This is it, this is it!

1517
01:19:26.970 --> 01:19:29.014
This is what I wanted, I

1518
01:19:29.097 --> 01:19:30.307
(Vincenzo)
I guess I have to break the principles I promised.

1519
01:19:30.390 --> 01:19:32.976
[Minseong’s surprised groan]
doesn't hurt anyone

1520
01:19:34.519 --> 01:19:36.521
Subtitle: Kwon Jeong-won

